  "body": "https://quirks.spec.whatwg.org/#the-percentage-height-calculation-quirk\r\n\r\nThe spec currently suggests that we \"maybe [should] bail\" for grids. Blink already does this, and is going to do the same for flex containers with https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/1459643 (EdgeHTML and Gecko already do it).\r\n\r\nCan we clarify this behavior?",
